---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base
  title="Build the Dunlin beta from source for macOS"
  description="Dunlin is in beta. Clone the repository and build from source on macOS 15+ with Apple Silicon. Prebuilt app downloads are paused until Apple signing and notarization are available."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pb-16 pt-32 sm:pt-36 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-44">
    <div class="page-container">
      <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay" data-reveal>
            <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
            Public beta · {site.version}
          </p>
          <h1
            class="mt-6 max-w-[720px] font-serif text-6xl leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.045em] sm:text-7xl"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: 60ms"
          >
            Build the beta.
          </h1>
          <p
            class="mt-7 max-w-[560px] text-base leading-7 text-ink/65 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: 120ms"
          >
            Dunlin is in beta. We recommend cloning the repository and building
            from source. Prebuilt app downloads and Homebrew installation are
            paused until Apple Developer ID signing and notarization are
            available.
          </p>

          <div
            class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"
          >
            <a href={site.sourceInstall} class="btn-primary">
              Build from source
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a href={site.github} class="btn-secondary">
              View repository
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div
            class="mt-6 max-w-[560px] rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper-soft px-4 py-3"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: 200ms"
          >
            <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted">
              Source installation
            </p>
            <code class="mt-2 block font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-ink/75">
              git clone https://github.com/corapoid/dunlin.git
              <br />
              cd dunlin
              <br />
              ./scripts/bundle-macos.sh --build
              <br />
              open dist/Dunlin.app
            </code>
          </div>
          <p
            class="mt-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted"
            data-reveal
            style="--reveal-delay: 220ms"
          >
            macOS 15+ · Apple Silicon · Rust 1.92+
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper-soft">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line px-5 py-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink/35">
                Beta source build
              </span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-moss-soft px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-moss">
                beta
              </span>
            </div>
            <dl class="divide-y divide-line">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4">
                <dt class="text-sm text-ink/50">Version</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink/80">
                  {site.version}
                </dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4">
                <dt class="text-sm text-ink/50">Architecture</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink/80">
                  arm64
                </dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4">
                <dt class="text-sm text-ink/50">Minimum</dt>
                <dd class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink/80">
                  macOS 15
                </dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4">
                <dt class="text-sm text-ink/50">Instructions</dt>
                <dd>
                  <a
                    href={site.sourceInstall}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                    class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink underline decoration-ink/20 underline-offset-4 hover:text-clay"
                  >
                    README
                  </a>
                </dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
            <div class="border-t border-line bg-paper px-5 py-4">
              <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-ink/55">
                Need the relay too?{" "}
                <a
                  href={site.downloadRelay}
                  class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-ink/20 underline-offset-4 hover:text-clay"
                >
                  Download dunlin-relay
                </a>
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-ink/55">
                Relay checksums:{" "}
                <a
                  href={site.relayChecksums}
                  class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-ink/20 underline-offset-4 hover:text-clay"
                >
                  RELAY-SHA256SUMS
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-line bg-paper-soft/50">
    <div class="page-container py-20 md:py-24">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <div data-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Before you install</p>
          <h2 class="mt-5 font-serif text-4xl leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">
            A short checklist.
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/70">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-moss"></span>
              macOS 15 or newer on an Apple Silicon Mac.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-moss"></span>
              An ACP harness, such as{" "}
              <span class="font-mono text-ink">opencode acp</span>.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-moss"></span>
              Git on your PATH for source control.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-moss"></span>
              Rust 1.92 or newer; rustup is recommended.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-clay"></span>
              No Intel build in this beta.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Install</p>
          <h2 class="mt-5 font-serif text-4xl leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">
            Clone, build, open.
          </h2>
          <ol class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/70">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-clay">01</span>
              Clone the repository and open its directory in your terminal.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-clay">02</span>
              Run{" "}
              <code class="font-mono">./scripts/bundle-macos.sh --build</code>.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-clay">03</span>
              Run <code class="font-mono">open dist/Dunlin.app</code>.
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-clay">04</span>
              Pick a folder and a harness. That is the setup.
            </li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-clay/20 bg-clay-soft/40 px-4 py-3 text-xs leading-5 text-ink/60">
            Local app bundles are ad-hoc signed, not Apple-notarized. You do not
            need an Apple Developer ID certificate to build from source. GitHub
            Packages publication is paused alongside prebuilt desktop downloads.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-container py-20 md:py-24">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 border-t border-line pt-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-3xl tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">
          Prefer a development run?
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/60">
          From your cloned repository, run{" "}
          <span class="font-mono text-ink">cargo run -p dunlin</span>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href={site.github}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
        class="btn-secondary"
      >
        View source
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
